      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_HkDNAi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>Read More</b>",
            "icon": "paw_print",
            "row_content": "<p>Becoming a dog owner is one of life’s most rewarding adventures. Welcoming a furry friend into your home brings endless joy, laughter, and companionship. As a pet owner, it’s important to recognize the responsibilities that come with caring for your new dog—starting with covering your pup's basic needs like a cozy dog bed and nutritious dog food to ensure your dog's comfort.</p><p>Before exploring extra accessories, make sure to cover your pup's essential needs to provide a solid foundation for your dog's well-being.</p><p>Whether you’re settling into a bustling New York City apartment or have plenty of space to roam on the land, there are dog accessories designed to fit every lifestyle. The best dog accessories can transform everything from daily walks to car rides and outdoor adventures, making each moment with your pet stress free and enjoyable. With the right preparation and mindset, you’ll create a loving environment where your dog can thrive.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
